From 5bf46d54e424c9806c2e857f89eb5e23d7567082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: martesi <96113508+martesi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:37:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] backport: update Classic package managers and shared fixes

Add Scoop version installs and pinned updates, improve WinGet identifiers and display names, and fix NuGet version and scope selection. Stop operations when requested processes cannot close, correct Bun release dates, and support invariant-culture translations. Adapt Scoop version input for WinUI and repair the existing PowerShell scope test.

